### Description
Audit bulgu #3: `NotifyDispatcher` class yazılmış (Sprint 139 T-41) ama instantiate edilmiyor, adapter eklenmiyor.

`src/core/notification-dispatcher.ts` mevcut. 3 adapter dosyası `src/core/notify-adapters/` altında olmalı (eğer eksikse oluştur):

```typescript
// src/core/notify-adapters/mcp-adapter.ts
import type { McpServer } from '@modelcontextprotocol/sdk/server/mcp.js';
import type { NotificationAdapter, NotifyEvent } from '../notification-dispatcher.js';

export class McpNotificationAdapter implements NotificationAdapter {
  readonly name = 'mcp' as const;
  constructor(private server: McpServer) {}
  async dispatch(event: NotifyEvent): Promise<void> {
    await this.server.server.sendLoggingMessage({
      level: event.payload.level === 'error' ? 'error' :
             event.payload.level === 'warn' ? 'warning' : 'info',
      logger: `deckent.sprint.${event.sprintId}`,
      data: { title: event.payload.title, body: event.payload.body, meta: event.payload.meta },
    });
  }
}

// src/core/notify-adapters/cli-adapter.ts
export class CliNotificationAdapter implements NotificationAdapter {
  readonly name = 'cli' as const;
  async dispatch(event: NotifyEvent): Promise<void> {
    const icon = event.payload.level === 'error' ? '🔴' : event.payload.level === 'warn' ? '🟡' : '🔵';
    process.stderr.write(`${icon} [${event.payload.title}] ${event.payload.body}\n`);
  }
}

// src/core/notify-adapters/file-adapter.ts
import { appendFileSync } from 'node:fs';
export class FileNotificationAdapter implements NotificationAdapter {
  readonly name = 'file' as const;
  constructor(private filePath: string) {}
  async dispatch(event: NotifyEvent): Promise<void> {
    appendFileSync(this.filePath, JSON.stringify(event) + '\n');
  }
}
```

`src/mcp/server.ts` startup:
```typescript
import { eventBus } from '../orchestra/event-bus.js';
import { NotifyDispatcher } from '../core/notification-dispatcher.js';
import { McpNotificationAdapter } from '../core/notify-adapters/mcp-adapter.js';
import { FileNotificationAdapter } from '../core/notify-adapters/file-adapter.js';
import { CHANNELS } from '../orchestra/event-stream.js';

const notifyDispatcher = new NotifyDispatcher();
notifyDispatcher.addAdapter(new McpNotificationAdapter(server));
notifyDispatcher.addAdapter(new FileNotificationAdapter('.deckent/notifications.jsonl'));

eventBus.on('event', (event) => {
  if (event.channel === CHANNELS.NOTIFY) {
    notifyDispatcher.dispatch(event).catch(() => {});
  }
});
```

`src/cli/entry.ts` benzer şekilde + `CliNotificationAdapter` ekler (sadece interactive CLI mode).

### Test (6+ test)
1. NotifyDispatcher 3 adapter ile çalışır, dispatch hepsine iletir
2. McpAdapter sendLoggingMessage çağırır (mock McpServer)
3. CliAdapter stderr'e icon + title + body yazar
4. FileAdapter belirtilen path'e JSONL append eder
5. Bir adapter throw atarsa diğerleri yine çalışır (Promise.allSettled)
6. Integration: eventBus.publish NOTIFY event → 3 adapter de tetiklendi

**Kanıt:** `npx vitest run tests/core/notification-dispatcher.test.ts` 6+/6+ PASS, MCP server start sonrası `eventBus.publish` ile NOTIFY emit → `.deckent/notifications.jsonl` yeni satır.

